<Document><name>Japan 2026 · Tōhoku loop</name><description>All ten riding-day flyovers for the October 2026 Tohoku motorcycle trip, in order. Open a day&apos;s folder and double-click the ▶ tour to play it. Each runs at 300 m (984 ft) above ground, tilt 60°. Route lines are switched off by default — tick one if you want to see the line on the ground.</description><open>1</open>
