<Folder><name>10/6 Tue · Shima Onsen → Sanjo</name><description>Kusatsu, then R292 over Shibu Pass at 2,172 m — the highest national road in Japan — down past Jigokudani Monkey Park and Shibu Onsen, out through Iiyama and the Uonuma rice country. Flyover runs 21 min at 300 m (984 ft) above ground, tilt 60°. Double-click the tour below to play it.</description><open>0</open><Style id="rt2"><LineStyle><color>b32fd5ff</color><width>3</width></LineStyle></Style><gx:Tour><name>▶ 10/6 Tue · Shima Onsen → Sanjo — 242 km (150 mi)</name><description>Kusatsu, then R292 over Shibu Pass at 2,172 m — the highest national road in Japan — down past Jigokudani Monkey Park and Shibu Onsen, out through Iiyama and the Uonuma rice country.</description><gx:Playlist><gx:FlyTo><gx:duration>4</gx:duration><gx:flyToMode>bounce</gx:flyToMode><Camera><longitude>138.774017</longitude><latitude>36.696923</latitude><altitude>300</altitude><heading>175.3</heading><tilt>60</tilt><altitudeMode>relativeToGround</altitudeMode></Camera></gx:FlyTo><gx:FlyTo><gx:duration>5.57</gx:duration><gx:flyToMode>smooth</gx:flyToMode><Camera><longitude>138.774662</longitude><latitude>36.690602</latitude><altitude>300</altitude><heading>159.7</heading><tilt>60</tilt><altitudeMode>relativeToGround</altitudeMode></Camera></gx:FlyTo><gx:FlyTo><gx:duration>5.57</gx:duration><gx:flyToMode>smooth</gx:flyToMode><Camera><longitude>138.778310</longitude><latitude>36.682706</latitude><altitude>300</altitude><heading>150.7</heading><tilt>60</tilt><altitudeMode>relativeToGround</altitudeMode></Camera></gx:FlyTo><gx:FlyTo><gx:duration>5.57</gx:duration><gx:flyToMode>smooth</gx:flyToMode><Camera><longitude>138.783116</longitude><latitude>36.675839</latitude><altitude>300</altitude><heading>146.1</heading><tilt>60</tilt><altitudeMode>relativeToGround</altitudeMode></Camera></gx:FlyTo><gx:FlyTo><gx:duration>5.57</gx:duration><gx:flyToMode>smooth</gx:flyToMode><Camera><longitude>138.788910</longitude><latitude>36.668930</latitude>